      },
      "text": "@kimmonismus @agnesai_sapiens The rule that a change only stays if it passes the tests is the part anyone can copy today. Keep a running lessons file for your agent, but add a rule only after it fixes a real failure you can rerun. Otherwise the playbook just grows into noise.",
      "url": "https://x.com/FiveStackAI/status/2122741250440794506"
    },
    {
